{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19104","headline":"寄杨八寿州 · 刘禹锡","name":"寄杨八寿州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风猎红旗入寿春，满城歌舞向朱轮。\n八公山下清淮水，千骑尘中白面人。\n桂岭雨余多鹤迹，茗园晴望似龙鳞。\n圣朝方用敢言者，次第应须旧谏臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}